WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
We're gonna lose him. Dropping in.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.960
It's Cable, 12 O'clock.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:13.120
New plan! Use all of your imaginary powers to stop Cable from killing that kid.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.720
Where is he? I can't see him.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.500
He's on top of you.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.500
He's going in through the back!

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.480
Oh, God, he's inside!
- You hear yourself, right?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.300
Accidental double entendres!

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.900
Got it! No, I don't....

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.460
Wade, you have a good heart. 
With training you can be X-Man.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.740
I am not X-Men material at all.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.860
First off, I'm not even a virgin.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.160
I ain't letting Cable kill this kid, but I can't do this alone.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.160
I'm an X-Man.
- Trainee!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.100
SHUT IT!

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.320
Stay back or Justin Bieber dies!

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.540
Ha! Justin Bieber, he called you Justin Bieber.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.400
You're no hero.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.140
You're just a clown

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.780
dressed up as a toy.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:58.080
So dark! You're sure you're not from the DC Universe?

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.760
My name is Cable. I'm here for the kid.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.300
Kids give us a chance to be better than we used to be.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.940
He needs you.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:07.880
Daddy's got this.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.860
I ain't letting Cable get to him, but I can't do this alone.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.860
I need your help, ladies.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.660
Understatement of the year?
- You're absolutely right!

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.640
I like this guy!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.920
Give him a chance.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.420
I ain't letting Cable kill this kid.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.080
We're gonna form a super-duper group.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.220
Our group will be forward thinking, gender neutral,

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.600
who will be known as X-Force!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.000
Isn't that a little derivative?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.600
You're absolutely right!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:50.020
I don't know much about this Cable fellow,

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.040
but I guarantee he hasn't killed as money people as melanoma has.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.100
Paul, zip it!

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.520
My name is Peter.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:00.800
Upoznaj... - Domino.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.340
What's your stick?
- I'm lucky.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.340
Luck isn't a super power.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.560
Yes, it is.
- No, it's not.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.940
You underestimate my powers.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.500
Nice! But not a super power.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.620
Yes, it is.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.080
Let's meet in the middle and say - no, it isn't.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.860
You're hired.
- Lucky me.

